# Becomes the Secret altinnator-maskinporten, which only Texas reads. It holds the Maskinporten client's key, under
# Texas's name for it (https://github.com/nais/texas). It is committed: Altinnator only runs locally against the Altinn
# mock from compose.yaml, never against TT02 or PROD, so it never holds a real key.
#
# The key is the same made-up key as in compose.yaml. It is not a secret: it belongs to no client at Maskinporten, so it
# cannot get a token from TT02 or PROD, and the mock accepts it because the mock does not check signatures. The value is
# taken literally, so the JSON is not quoted.
